<reference id="_headingha772rpvek4g6" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 13 — Admonition Between Numbered List in a Workflow</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a workflow where the author has inserted an admonition between two numbered items to</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>release</keyword>
        <keyword>Workflow</keyword>
        <keyword>workflow</keyword>
        <keyword>Admonition</keyword>
        <keyword>Scenario</keyword>
        <keyword>Between</keyword>
        <indexterm>release</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Workflow</indexterm>
        <indexterm>workflow</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>  
     <section>
    <p>Consider a workflow where the author has inserted an admonition between two numbered items to call out supplementary or cautionary information relevant to the stage just described.</p>
        <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
           <title>Admonition between stages in workflow</title>
           <tgroup cols="2">
              <colspec colname="c1"/>
              <colspec colname="c2"/>
              <thead>
                 <row>
                    <entry>
                       <b>HTML Input</b>
                    </entry>
                    <entry>
                       <b>DITA Output</b>
                    </entry>
                 </row>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                 <row>
                    <entry>
                       <codeblock>
&lt;h2 id="release-workflow">Release Workflow&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>
    Merge the release branch.
    &lt;div class="note">
      Merging triggers an automatic build in the CI pipeline.
    &lt;/div>
  &lt;/li>
  &lt;li>Tag the release.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></codeblock>
                    </entry>
                    <entry>
                       <codeblock>
&lt;concept id="release_workflow">
  &lt;title>Release Workflow&lt;/title>
  &lt;conbody>
    &lt;ol>
      &lt;li>
        Merge the release branch.
        &lt;note>
          &lt;p>Merging triggers an automatic build in the CI pipeline.&lt;/p>
        &lt;/note>
      &lt;/li>
      &lt;li>
        Tag the release.
      &lt;/li>
    &lt;/ol>
  &lt;/conbody>
&lt;/concept></codeblock>
                    </entry>
                 </row>
              </tbody>
           </tgroup>
        </table>
        <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The admonition is nested inside the preceding <codeph>&lt;li&gt;</codeph> as a <codeph>&lt;note&gt;</codeph> element rather than splitting the <codeph>&lt;ol&gt;</codeph> into two independent lists.</p>
  </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
